    <text><list><item>Type 2 diabetes mellitus with diabetic autonomic neuropathy; HbA1c above the individualized goal at intake: active, confirmed [S]</item><item>Neurogenic orthostatic hypotension from diabetic autonomic neuropathy: active, confirmed [S]</item><item>Diabetic distal symmetric polyneuropathy with loss of protective sensation in both feet: active, confirmed [S]</item><item>Primary open-angle glaucoma, both eyes, severe stage: active, confirmed [S]</item><item>Mild nonproliferative diabetic retinopathy without macular edema, both eyes: active, confirmed [S]</item><item>Hyperlipidemia: active, confirmed [S]</item><item>History of recurrent pneumonia: active, confirmed [S]</item></list><paragraph>Coordinated follow-up with the primary clinician is appropriate. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

